  "verseCount": 31,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Thiec Kua̱r kɛ luek kä I-ca-yaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci kuäär ni Ɣidh-ki-yaa jɛ liŋ cuɛ bieynikɛ rɛ̈t kɛ jiath lɔaac, kä cuɛ rɔ kum kɛ bieyni cuali kä cuɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Ɛl-ya-kim gui̱i̱c cieŋ, kɛnɛ Cɛb-naa in la bolith, kɛ bo̱o̱th palä mi di̱i̱t mi ci rɔ kum kɛ bieyni cuali jäk kä gök ni I-ca-yaa gat A-modh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ jɛ jiök i̱, “Ci kuäär nɛmɛ lar, ni̱n ti̱ti̱ kɛ ni̱n ti jiäk, kɛ ni̱n bɛɛlä, ti thil gɔy. Ce̱tkɛ kɛ ni̱n tin dap kɛ ni gaat, kä thilɛ buɔ̱m mi dap kɛ nikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä dɔ̱ŋ bi Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu rieet Rɛ̈b-ca-kee diaal liŋ, min ci kuäärɛ kuäär A-thi-ri-ya jɛ ja̱k bëë Kuoth in tëk ben kuëth, kä ci Kuoth Nhial Kuothdu kueth ti̱ti̱ mal liŋ, kä bɛ nɛy tin lat kɛ kɛ duäc. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ pali kɛ kui̱ nɛɛni tin ci duɔth.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min ci la̱a̱t kua̱r ben kä I-ca-yaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu I-ca-yaa kɛ jiök i̱, “La̱rɛ jɛ kuäärun i̱ ci Kuoth Nhial wee, ‘/Cu dual kɛ ruac in ci liŋ, min ci raan kɔar kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya ɛ lat kɛ kui̱dä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ɣän bä moc yiëë, bɛ thuk lieeŋ kä bɛ loc wi̱i̱dɛ. Kä bä jɛ jak kä li̱w kɛ mut wi̱i̱dɛ.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jäkni ji̱ Thi-ri-ya kɛ dhia̱a̱t",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Rɛ̈b-ca-kee rɔ rit kä cuɛ kuäär A-thi-ri-ya jek ko̱o̱r kɛ Lib-na. Kɛ ɣöö cɛ liŋ i̱ ci kuäär jiɛn kä La-kic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci kuäär ɛ liŋ i̱, “Kuäär I-jëp ni Tir-ɣa-kaa, raan Kuc, cɛ ben raar bëë ben nyiëëny kɛ jɛ.” Cuɛ naath nyɔk kɛ jäk kä Ɣidh-ki-yaa wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“La̱tdɛ nɛmɛ Ɣidh-ki-yaa kuäär Juda i̱, ‘Ɛ Kuothdu ci ji̱ kaŋ i̱ /cɛ Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm bi ka̱m kuäär A-thi-ri-ya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nɛnɛ, ci mëë ci kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya jɛ lät kä mun kɛɛliw liŋ, ca da̱k ni piny. Kä ji̱n bi kän? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci kuth döörkiɛn kän, döör tëë ci gua̱a̱ri kɛ däk, Go-dhan, Ɣa-ran, Rɛ-dhɛp, kɛ ji̱ E-dɛn tëë cieŋ kä Tɛ-lɛ̈-thar? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kuäär Ä-math, kɛnɛ kuäär Ar-pad, kɛ kuäär wec Thɛ-par-wa-yim, kɛ kuäär Ɣenɛ̈, kɛ kuäär Iwaa ka nikä?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa warɛgak ka̱n tetni ja̱a̱kni, kä cuɛ kuɛn. Kä cuɛ wä rɛy luaak Kuɔth Nhial, kä cuɛ jɛ wä ɣär nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɣidh-ki-yaa pal nhiam Kuɔth Nhial wëë i̱, “Aɣ, Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl, min te kɔm kuäärädɛ nhial wi̱i̱ pua̱nyni jaakni, ɛ ji̱n Kuoth ni kä rɔa min ruaac kuäär wec muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw. Kä cak nhial kɛnɛ piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Päli ji̱thdu piny lö Kuoth Nhial, kä li̱ŋni. Kä lɛp waŋdu lö Kuoth Nhial, kä guicni. Kä liŋ ruac Thɛ̈n-ke-rib, min kuethɛ ni Kuoth in tëk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛ thuɔ̱k lö Kuoth Nhial, kɛn kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya ca döör ti ŋuan däk kɛnɛ wi̱i̱kiɛn, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä cikɛ kuthkiɛn yuɔr maac. Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ kɛ kuth, kɛ ti la̱tkɛ kɛ tet nath, kɛ jiɛn, kɛnɛ pääm. Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ca kɛ däk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä täämɛ lö Kuoth Nhial Kuothda kän nɛy tetkädɛ, la̱ŋä ni ji̱, kä ba cu ŋa̱c ɛ wi̱c muɔ̱ɔ̱n kɛɛliw lö Kuoth Nhial i̱ ɛ ji̱n la Kuoth ɔ ni kä rɔa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ruac I-ca-yaa kɛ kuäär",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu I-ca-yaa gat A-modh Ɣidh-ki-yaa jäk kä raan wee i̱, “Ci Kuoth Nhial, Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl wee, cä palu liŋ kɛ kui̱ kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya ni Thɛ̈n-ke-rib. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛ mi ɛ ruac in ci Kuoth Nhial ɛ lat kɛ kui̱dɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kä nɛmɛ ba nyuuth kä ji̱. Ɛn waalɛ bi cam ni min ciɛk kä rɔa, kä kɛ ruɔ̱n in rɛwdɛ bia cam ni min ci duɔth thi̱n. Kä kɛ ruɔ̱n in diɔ̱ɔ̱kdiɛn bi pi̱eth, kä bi ŋɛɛr, kä pith dɛy wal kä cam dɛykiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi duɔth ji̱ dhɔaar Juda rɔ yiath piny kä bikɛ tekɛ kuay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm bɛ te duɔth ti bä thi̱n, kä bi buɔ̱n ben pääm Dha-yɔn. Bi tiɛɛl nhök Kuɔth Nhial ɛ la̱t.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kɛ kui̱c ɛmɔ ci Kuoth Nhial nɛmɛ lar kɛ kui̱ kua̱r A-thi-ri-ya i̱, ‘Cɛ bi ben ɛn wi̱c ɛmɛ, kä cɛ bäär bi yuɔr ɛn wa̱nɛ, kä /cɛ bi rët kɛ nhiamdɛ kɛ ko̱t, kä /cɛ jɛ bi go̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱p ëë bäkɛ jɛ, ɛ jɛn bi loc kɛ jɛ jɔk ɔ, kä /cɛ bi ben ɛn wi̱c ɛ mi ruac ni Kuoth Nhial inɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö ɣän bä wec ɛ mi, gaŋ, kä bä kän kɛ kui̱dä, kɛnɛ kui̱ jäŋädä ni Dee-bid.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
